<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" version="1.1" creator="Canarias 360 official route + organiser roadbook"><metadata><name>Canarias 360 2026 — official route and 29 roadbook waypoints</name><desc>Track geometry from 360_2026_Total.gpx; waypoints from 360_2026_Waypoints.gpx; numbered English instructions from the supplied official roadbook PDF. Consecutive zero-length duplicates removed; coordinates otherwise unchanged. Waypoint elevations sampled from the track, replacing source zero placeholders.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="28.144779" lon="-15.655717"><ele>119.0</ele><name>WP 01 · Gáldar</name><desc>Gáldar. Race start. Original GPX label: SALIDA. GÁLDAR</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.025853" lon="-15.627137"><ele>1321.4</ele><name>WP 02 · Navigation · next 700 m</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation for the next 700 m. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN EN LOS PRÓXIMOS 700 METROS</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.030621" lon="-15.635482"><ele>1182.8</ele><name>WP 03 · Navigation · until the town</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation until reaching the town. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN HASTA ALCANZAR LA POBLACIÓN</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.019978" lon="-15.646547"><ele>1230.0</ele><name>WP 04 · Artenara</name><desc>Aid station. Cut-off: Wednesday 4 November at 19:55. No sleeping lifebase at Artenara. Original GPX label: AVIT. ARTENARA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.015095" lon="-15.64519"><ele>1123.2</ele><name>WP 05 · Overgrown trail</name><desc>Caution: dense vegetation / overgrown trail until the next junction. Original GPX label: VEGETACIÓN HASTA EL PRÓXIMO CRUCE DE PISTA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.001937" lon="-15.649327"><ele>590.2</ele><name>WP 06 · Navigation · extreme caution</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation. Extreme caution. Original GPX label: EXTREME PRECAUCIÓN Y ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.96861" lon="-15.674469"><ele>681.3</ele><name>WP 07 · Navigation · until the road</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation until reaching the road. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN HASTA LLEGAR A LA CARRETERA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.957236" lon="-15.656302"><ele>1202.9</ele><name>WP 08 · Navigation · next 1.5 km</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation for the next 1.5 km. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN EN LOS PRÓXIMOS 1.5 KM.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.963613" lon="-15.631983"><ele>1340.0</ele><name>WP 09 · Aserrador</name><desc>Cut-off point. Cut-off: Thursday 5 November at 05:35. A control point is not a confirmed food or sleeping service. Original GPX label: PC 1. ASERRADOR</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.914486" lon="-15.629658"><ele>932.0</ele><name>WP 10 · Cercados de Araña</name><desc>Life base 1 — Cercados de Araña. Published kilometre 79.2. Cut-off: Thursday 5 November at 10:05. Original GPX label: BV 1. CERCADOS DE ARAÑA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.855761" lon="-15.62793"><ele>764.2</ele><name>WP 11 · Navigation</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.78213" lon="-15.652551"><ele>233.3</ele><name>WP 12 · Steep drop-off</name><desc>Caution. Risk of fall from height / steep drop-off. Original GPX label: EXTREME PRECAUCIÓN. RIESGO DE CAÍDA A DISTINTO NIVEL</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.751084" lon="-15.639823"><ele>2.1</ele><name>WP 13 · Coastal conditions · next 3.5 km</name><desc>For the next 3.5 km, use the inland trail alternative in case of high seas / rough sea conditions. An alternative GPX was not supplied; do not invent a connecting route. Original GPX label: EN LOS PRÓXIMOS 3.5 KM USAR ALTERNATIVA DE SENDERO MÁS LEJOS DE LA COSTA EN CASO DE TEMPORAL DE MAR</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.759383" lon="-15.598812"><ele>25.0</ele><name>WP 14 · Pedestrian footbridge</name><desc>Caution. Use the pedestrian footbridge / overpass to cross the road. Original GPX label: USAR PASO PEATONAL ELEVADO PARA CRUZAR LA VÍA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.764578" lon="-15.596587"><ele>32.0</ele><name>WP 15 · Parque Sur</name><desc>Life base 2 — Parque Sur (Maspalomas). Published kilometre 121.68. Cut-off: Friday 6 November at 01:35. Original GPX label: BV 2. PARQUE SUR</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.791445" lon="-15.587023"><ele>87.3</ele><name>WP 16 · Navigation · next 7 km</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation for the next 7 km until reaching the dirt track. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN EN LOS PRÓXIMOS 7 KM. hASTA CONECTAR CON LA PISTA DE TIERRA.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.825284" lon="-15.587965"><ele>468.8</ele><name>WP 17 · Steep drop-off</name><desc>Caution. Risk of fall from height / steep drop-off. Original GPX label: PRECAUCIÓN. RIESGO DE CAÍDA A DISTINTO NIVEL EN LOS PRÓXIMOS METROS</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.818117" lon="-15.586891"><ele>156.0</ele><name>WP 18 · Navigation · until the track</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation until reaching the track. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN HASTA CONECTAR CON LA PISTA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.895611" lon="-15.578118"><ele>928.0</ele><name>WP 19 · Navigation · next kilometre</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation for the next kilometre. Original GPX label: ATENCIÓN A LA NAVEGACIÓN EN EL PRÓXIMO KM.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.913873" lon="-15.533594"><ele>789.7</ele><name>WP 20 · Santa Lucía</name><desc>Life base 3 — Santa Lucía. Published kilometre 163.6. Cut-off: Friday 6 November at 19:40. Original GPX label: BV 3. SANTA LUCÍA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.945674" lon="-15.471159"><ele>717.0</ele><name>WP 21 · La Pasadilla</name><desc>Cut-off point. Cut-off: Saturday 7 November at 05:50. A control point is not a confirmed food or sleeping service. Original GPX label: PC 2. LA PASADILLA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.943455" lon="-15.508521"><ele>1305.5</ele><name>WP 22 · Close the gate</name><desc>Close the gate behind you. Original GPX label: CERRAR CANCELA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.959431" lon="-15.521765"><ele>1366.4</ele><name>WP 23 · Trail washout / collapsed trail</name><desc>Caution. Trail washout / collapsed trail. Follow organiser directions; no replacement trail geometry is supplied. Original GPX label: DERRUMBE SENDERO</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.00959" lon="-15.500976"><ele>746.0</ele><name>WP 24 · Navigation · narrow trail entrance</name><desc>Pay close attention to navigation. GPX label: narrow trail entrance. Original GPX label: ENTRADA SENDERO ESTRECHO</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.020165" lon="-15.482157"><ele>561.7</ele><name>WP 25 · Slippery ground</name><desc>Caution. Slippery ground / slippery surface until reaching the road. Original GPX label: PRECAUCIÓN. FIRME RESBALADIZO</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.034526" lon="-15.500327"><ele>507.0</ele><name>WP 26 · Santa Brígida</name><desc>Life base 4 — Santa Brígida. Published kilometre 212.99. Cut-off: Saturday 7 November at 18:30. Original GPX label: BV 4 SANTA BRÍGIDA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.074196" lon="-15.541325"><ele>632.0</ele><name>WP 27 · Alternative gate passage</name><desc>Alternative passage around the main gate / side gate alternative. Original GPX label: PASO ALTERNATIVO A LA PUERTA PRINCIPAL</desc></wpt><wpt lat="28.054469" lon="-15.567958"><ele>907.5</ele><name>WP 28 · Balcón de Zamora</name><desc>Cut-off point. Cut-off: Sunday 8 November at 06:10. A control point is not a confirmed food or sleeping service. Original GPX label: PC3. BALCÓN DE ZAMORA</desc></wpt><wpt lat="27.995765" lon="-15.6154"><ele>1039.0</ele><name>WP 29 · Tejeda</name><desc>Finish: Tejeda. Published kilometre 254.11. Cut-off: Sunday 8 November at 14:00. Original GPX label: META. TEJEDA</desc></wpt><trk><name>Canarias 360 2026 official</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="28.144767" lon="-15.655684"><ele>119.0</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="28.144802" lon="-15.656415"><ele>119.0</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="28.145153" lon="-15.656391"><ele>118.0</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="28.145143" lon="-15.655734"><ele>118.0</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="28.145215" lon="-15.655734"><ele>118.0</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="28.14